json←plotSpecJson spec;n;pairs;keys;vals
⍝ Convert flat spec vector ('type' 'barY' 'x' 'dep' ...) to JSON object text.
 :If 0≠2|≢spec
     ⎕SIGNAL 'Spec vector must have an even number of elements'
 :EndIf
 n←(≢spec)÷2
 pairs←(2,n)⍴spec
 keys←pairs[0;]
 vals←(⊂¨pairs[1;])
 json←⎕JSON ⊂ 4 (vals keys)
